Collapsible Dashboard Menu Collapsible Dashboard Menu https://github.com/cboulanger/ojs-dashboard-collapse Collapses the left menu of the editorial backend to its icons, so that pages have more room on smaller screens. A click on an icon opens the menu as a drawer over the page; counts in the menu become badges on the icons. Collapses the left menu of the editorial backend to its icons, so that pages have more room on smaller screens. A click on an icon opens the menu as a drawer over the page; counts in the menu become badges on the icons. @DESCRIPTION@ @DESCRIPTION@
